61001000 TEXT 238 249 568 283 F5F7FAFF "Set up your first game"
61001001 TEXT 238 297 1020 323 9AA4B2FF "This wizard checks a disc image of a PSP game you own, stages its files on this PC, and gets"
61001001 TEXT 238 323 468 349 9AA4B2FF "it ready to build and play."
